 advice","fpl captain","fpl ai","best fpl team","fpl salah","fpl 24/25","fpl 2024/25","fantasy premier league 24/25","fpl first draft","fantasy premier league first draft"],"channelId":"UCcqEr3DfrRwtoF2a1yW8qgQ","isOwnerViewing":false,"shortDescription":"Get your FPL Team rated FOR FREE ⤵️\nhttps://go.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/ai-team-rating?utm_source=youtube\u0026utm_medium=hubyoutube\u0026utm_campaign=jack26\u0026via=jack26\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n@Redditor chats to FPL expert BigManBakar who gives FPL Tips \u0026 Advice For Heading Into The New Fantasy Premier League 2026/27 season!\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nCHAPTERS 📖\n00:00 Intro\n00:48 Pre-Season\n01:35 Gameweek 1 Team\n08:30 Player Ownership Tips\n09:43 Fixture Tips\n14:16 General Advice On FPL\n17:38 AI Transfers \u0026 FFH Tools\n20:42 How Bias Affects Your FPL Team\n21:09 Importance Of Captaincy\n22:08 Mini League\n23:07 Final Thoughts\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nFOLLOW US 👇\n🎯 Site: https://fantasyfootballhub.co.uk/\n🐦 Hub Twitter: https://twitter.com/FFH_HQ\n📸 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/FFH_HQ/\n✅ TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@FFH_HQ\n🔵 Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/ffootballhub/\n🐦 Jack's Twitter: https://twitter.com/redditoryt\n🐦 Will's Twitter: https://twitter.com/ffh_will\n🐦 Edited By Stevo: https://twitter.com/Editor_Stevo\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nABOUT 💭\nFantasy Football Hub brings you the very best Fantasy Premier League tools, players, writers, bloggers and content creators under one roof. If you're looking for fantasy football advice, we are the channel for you.\n\n#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #PremierLeague","isCrawlable":true,"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dI-MI7cIWQ4/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCKgBEF5IWvKriqkDGQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AbgC9xg=\u0026rs=AOn4CLDQ5Xs63sPjB4LQW7UAPhcLC4KNWA","width":168,"height":94},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dI-MI7cIWQ4/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCMQBEG5IWvKriqkDGQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AbgC9xg=\u0026rs=AOn4CLAtGhsThkVe3sgZebDDK_2mmp9pIQ","width":196,"